<title>USA: Clear Channel Q2 shr $0.17 vs $0.17.</title>
<headline>Clear Channel Q2 shr $0.17 vs $0.17.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 0.17	   $	 0.17</p>
<p> Net			 15,094		   12,548</p>
<p> Net Revs		 186,779		   81,368</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  89,459		   71,839</p>
<p>6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 0.27	   $	 0.26</p>
<p> Net			 22,693		   18,786</p>
<p> Net Revs		 285,068		  143,577</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  84,510		   71,180</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said after-tax cash flow during the second quarter of 1997 rose to $52.7 million, or $0.59 per share, compared with $24.25 million, or $0.34 per share, for the quarter a year ago.</p>
<p>Gross revenues increased to $212.2 million in the 1997 quarter from $92.4 million in the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Clear Channel Communications Inc.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
